WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,260 --> 00:00:02,160
Ruoyun

2
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:03,940
I'm not kidding

3
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:06,940
I mean it's not appropriate. Just get a bodyguard.

4
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:10,980
It's not surprising that a rich man doesn't have many bodyguards around him, but this whole day

5
00:00:10,980 --> 00:00:13,740
If you follow him twenty-four hours a day, you are a man and you are a woman.

6
00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:14,660
This is inconvenient

7
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:17,140
And is this necessary? What happened?

8
00:00:18,260 --> 00:00:19,380
Why did your dad suddenly remember

9
00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:26,220
I have to find a bodyguard for you. I haven’t seen your father find a bodyguard for you for so many years. And you have lived alone outside for so many years.

10
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:27,220
Your dad didn't say anything

11
00:00:27,960 --> 00:00:30,600
I forgot to tell you about this two days ago

12
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:31,880
Driving back that night

13
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:41,420
I was robbed on the way. Are you okay? If something happens, can I sit here and feed you now? Just because of this.

14
00:00:41,420 --> 00:00:43,140
My dad insists on arranging such a bodyguard for me

15
00:00:43,740 --> 00:00:45,620
I don't understand the robbery thing

16
00:00:45,620 --> 00:00:46,580
It's random

17
00:00:46,900 --> 00:00:47,820
I can't be so casual

18
00:00:47,820 --> 00:00:50,700
Come to me for every robbery and

19
00:00:51,060 --> 00:00:56,260
Isn't robbery just about money? If you encounter someone with money, wouldn't it be over? Miss Fang

20
00:00:57,100 --> 00:01:00,300
You can't hide from luck when it comes to safety Yu Han

21
00:01:00,980 --> 00:01:02,260
As sisters, I have to say a few words to you.

22
00:01:02,980 --> 00:01:05,780
I think your dad did the right thing. If it were me, I would do the same thing.

23
00:01:06,380 --> 00:01:07,380
You put yourself in your dad’s shoes

24
00:01:07,380 --> 00:01:08,380
Think about this question

25
00:01:10,190 --> 00:01:12,350
I know you have an independent personality and don’t like being around me

26
00:01:12,350 --> 00:01:13,270
A stranger is following

27
00:01:13,790 --> 00:01:14,990
Like to live alone

28
00:01:16,020 --> 00:01:20,280
But no matter what, safety first is my own

29
00:01:20,280 --> 00:01:21,520
I can accept it after thinking about it carefully.

30
00:01:21,880 --> 00:01:23,160
I know it's because my dad is worried about me

31
00:01:24,040 --> 00:01:27,970
Mainly because I really can't stand this country bumpkin.

32
00:01:28,570 --> 00:01:29,690
Judging from the clothing

33
00:01:29,690 --> 00:01:32,220
It seems that this person is a bit unscrupulous.

34
00:01:32,780 --> 00:01:33,820
It doesn't seem that simple
